{"voice_key": "taiwan_ad_male", "clips": [{"id": "b01", "size_bytes_reported_by_fish": 71052, "sha256_verified_by_provider_probe": "18b35412a8771f85615c804779d24b938a4f12ed688f29c584c38a54ad9a68d0", "file_name": "fish-tts-1795512718-vZPjDvOZ.mp3", "text": "學校視力不良率變低了，孩子近視也變少了嗎？先別急。"}, {"id": "b02", "size_bytes_reported_by_fish": 101981, "sha256_verified_by_provider_probe": "f092dad30765cdc3e63f4026eeb2cb9855a29e68edde095c8a8a71380ad8c37b", "file_name": "fish-tts-1795512728-VRl8NJoi.mp3", "text": "想像一間國小教室，孩子說看不清楚黑板，這一句話背後，其實有兩種全國數字。"}, {"id": "b03", "size_bytes_reported_by_fish": 134581, "sha256_verified_by_provider_probe": "42485510bcc30e03f52209e816b736a70a41984c62a8455240857cb6338cafeb", "file_name": "fish-tts-1795512732-J7eGWHqa.mp3", "text": "第一種是近視調查。一九八六年，小六近視率，約百分之二十七點五；到了兩千年，是百分之六十點六。"}, {"id": "b04", "size_bytes_reported_by_fish": 101981, "sha256_verified_by_provider_probe": "7308f81d0df2bf1df9d8c2df32ce5c06046c3981e70eed9dc4661c6421d7eaa0", "file_name": "fish-tts-1795512736-qCUr3Etw.mp3", "text": "但早年的門檻是負零點二五度，後來改用負零點五度，尺不一樣，不能接成一條線。"}, {"id": "b05", "size_bytes_reported_by_fish": 104906, "sha256_verified_by_provider_probe": "758e71c423e01a380c25391054dc17131f443495e6cfccde64e976b166904c83", "file_name": "fish-tts-1795512740-F-BJApOU.mp3", "text": "同樣用負零點五度，二零一零年小六是百分之六十二，二零一七年是百分之七十點六。"}, {"id": "b06", "size_bytes_reported_by_fish": 88606, "sha256_verified_by_provider_probe": "5371617a26897234056d5430d3a5bb69a7e1e06f7500d5fb727ffc5d62e0ab48", "file_name": "fish-tts-1795512744-KRPafVLw.mp3", "text": "第二種，是學校每年做的裸眼視力篩檢，量的是視力不良，不是近視度數。"}, {"id": "b07", "size_bytes_reported_by_fish": 126640, "sha256_verified_by_provider_probe": "2b20c408ec7a1c1f1822ec6cac956bd09adf778693b4ac24cdc065a5af1714ce", "file_name": "fish-tts-1795512748-b3RlY-RM.mp3", "text": "二零一四學年度，國小視力不良率，是百分之四十七點零五。到了二零二四學年度，是百分之四十四點八三。"}, {"id": "b08", "size_bytes_reported_by_fish": 107414, "sha256_verified_by_provider_probe": "ee20fb2a14ccd58669fb1ae617824e69ceed54f0555f5d810cc721f465cb982b", "file_name": "fish-tts-1795512752-5S80L0wh.mp3", "text": "一條往上、一條往下，看起來很矛盾？其實兩者不是同一個指標，不能放在同一把尺上比。"}, {"id": "b09", "size_bytes_reported_by_fish": 109504, "sha256_verified_by_provider_probe": "afd88ba2ce035c322668f2f941cc3a4fb8936a1b86a425df89c6127b57359020", "file_name": "fish-tts-1795512756-YbZE7LB-.mp3", "text": "二零二二年也有新調查被報導，但原始報告和方法還沒核對，現在不能說近視已經下降。"}, {"id": "b10", "size_bytes_reported_by_fish": 94457, "sha256_verified_by_provider_probe": "a89ec59c5123cd2f45906efd6cee94dd5721affe41f858df0c76574c11709d58", "file_name": "fish-tts-1795512759-Hm0wwIoy.mp3", "text": "一次視力篩檢是提醒，不代表知道近視度數。孩子的眼睛，更需要持續追蹤。"}]}